# G: tweety.ttl plus Bird and Flier disjoint. OWL 2 RL's cax-dw derives false:
# the graph is inconsistent, and in the semantics its content is incoherent (Proposition 2).
@prefix ex:   <http://ex.org/> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

ex:tweety rdf:type ex:Bird .
ex:Bird rdfs:subClassOf ex:Flier .
ex:Bird owl:disjointWith ex:Flier .
